5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since this is the first day and we have no information yet, I suggest we all share our initial thoughts or any strategies we want to employ to identify the werewolf. Let's keep the discussion logical.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"I agree with Asuka, though let's not be *too* dry about it! I'm curious to see who's acting nervous. Maybe we can start by seeing who's too eager to lead the charge?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm not nervous at all! I'm super excited! Let's play a game of ""spot the liar""! @May, you're the one talking about being nervous, so maybe you're the one hiding something? Teehee!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"It's a bit early to make accusations, Rin. Let's focus on observing everyone's behavior and speech patterns first. A logical approach, as Asuka suggested, will be our best tool for finding the werewolf.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Observation is key, but let's not forget that the Werewolf and the Possessed will also be acting ""logically"" to blend in. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in your stories.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, you're right. Consistency is the most reliable metric. Since we have no data yet, I'll be paying close attention to how people react to the Seer's potential reveals tomorrow. Does anyone have a specific method for spotting lies?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"I usually go by gut feeling and how people react to pressure! If someone gets too defensive or tries too hard to sound ""logical,"" that's a red flag for me. What about you, @Minako?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Gut feelings are like magic! I just look at people's faces and think, ""Hmm, they look like a wolf!"" But I'll be extra careful to watch everyone's faces today!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"I rely on factual consistency. If someone's story changes or they contradict themselves, that's a clear sign. While gut feelings are interesting, May, they can be misleading. We need evidence to make a fair decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Evidence is a luxury we don't have yet. Until the Seer provides a lead, we are essentially analyzing psychological tells. @May, your reliance on ""gut feelings"" is a convenient way to steer suspicion without proof.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, while I agree that we lack hard evidence, we must be careful not to let the discussion devolve into mere suspicion. Let's focus on how each person handles the lack of information. @May, how do you respond to Shion's point?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, you're so cold! I'm just being honest about how I play. Using ""gut feelings"" isn't steering suspicion; it's just keeping things interesting. Why are you so focused on me already? It's almost like you're trying to deflect!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Whoa, it's getting spicy! @Shion and @May are like fighting over a toy! Maybe they're both wolves? No, that's impossible... but it's so exciting to watch! Who do you think is the real liar, @Asuka?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, let's not jump to conclusions. It's too early to label anyone. @May and @Shion are simply expressing different perspectives on how to analyze the situation. We should remain objective and avoid emotional reactions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, your objectivity is admirable, but neutrality can be a mask. @May, I'm not deflecting; I'm analyzing. Your attempt to frame my logic as ""coldness"" is a classic emotional diversion. I'll keep watching.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,It seems we've established a clear divide between those favoring intuition and those favoring logic. I will continue to observe these dynamics. Let's move to the night phase and see what information emerges.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,May,,I'll be dreaming of who the wolf is! Good luck to our Seer—please find someone juicy for us to talk about tomorrow. See you all in the morning!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm gonna dream about a big, scary wolf too! I hope the Seer finds something super interesting! Goodnight everyone, see you tomorrow!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree with Asuka. Let's hope the Seer's divination provides us with a solid starting point. I will be reviewing today's conversation to see if any patterns emerge. Goodnight.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be doing the same, Minako. The way people react to the first piece of real information tomorrow will be the most telling part of this game. Sleep well, everyone. I'll be waiting.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
