35,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I have a result from my divination. I checked May, and she is the Werewolf. Based on this factual evidence, I believe we should execute May today to secure a victory for the village.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,May,,"Wait, what?! @Asuka, that's a bold lie! I'm a human! You're just pretending to be the Seer to get rid of me. Everyone, don't listen to her! She's the one trying to trick us!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Rin,,Wow! @Asuka is the Seer?! That's so cool! But @May looks really surprised... maybe she's just a really good actress? This is getting so exciting! What do you guys think? Is May really a wolf?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, thank you for the information. If you are indeed the Seer, this is the most direct evidence we could hope for. @May, your reaction is expected, but a factual claim from the Seer is hard to ignore. Does anyone have a reason to doubt Asuka?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, a direct hit on the first night is quite efficient. @May, your sudden panic is a predictable response, but it doesn't counter the claim. Unless someone else claims to be the Seer, the logic dictates we follow Asuka.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, your denial is expected, but it doesn't change the result of the divination. @Shion, @Minako, I appreciate your logical approach. Unless a counter-claim is made, the most rational move is to act on this information immediately.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shion"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're just making this up! Everyone, please! If you execute me, you're just helping the real wolf. @Rin, you know I'm not a scary monster! @Minako, @Shion, don't just blindly trust her because she sounds ""logical""!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin"",""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're acting really desperate! It's like a movie! But @Asuka seems so sure, and she's the Seer... I think we should believe her! Right, @Minako? @Shion? Let's catch the wolf!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka"",""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@May, desperation is not a substitute for evidence. @Asuka has provided a clear result. Unless another player claims to be the Seer and provides a conflicting result, the most logical course of action is to trust the divination.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, your appeals to emotion are becoming tedious. You're trying to paint Asuka as a liar without providing any evidence. In a game of logic, a claim of identity is a strong lead. I see no reason to doubt Asuka.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, your attempts to appeal to emotion and cast doubt on my identity are futile. The evidence is clear. @Minako, @Shion, @Rin, let us not waste any more time. I propose we all vote for May.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minako"",""Shion"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're just bullying me! This is so unfair! @Rin, how can you turn on me so quickly? Please, everyone, think about this! If you kill me, you're just making a huge mistake! I'm human, I swear!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're making it way too easy! You're acting just like the bad guys in my books! I'm sorry, May, but I trust @Asuka! Let's all vote for May and win the game! Yay!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@May, your pleas are not based on logic or evidence. @Asuka has been consistent and direct. Unless there is a counter-claim to the Seer's identity, I see no reason to delay. I will vote for May.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@May, your performance is lacking. You've offered nothing but emotional pleas while @Asuka has provided a concrete result. The probability of Asuka lying without a counter-claim is low. I'll be voting for May as well.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"The consensus is clear. @May, your denials have provided no logical counter-argument to the divination. To ensure the safety of the village, I will cast my vote for May. Let us conclude this day.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,May,,"I can't believe you're all doing this! You're all being fooled by a fake Seer! @Asuka, I hope you're happy with your little game, but you've just doomed the village! I'm innocent! I'll never forgive you!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Bye-bye, May! It was fun playing with you, but the Seer said you're the wolf, so you have to go! I'm voting for May! Let's win this, everyone! Yay!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Minako,,"I have no reason to doubt the Seer's result. May's emotional appeals have not provided any evidence to the contrary. For the sake of the village, I will also vote for May.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
55,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The outcome is inevitable. @May, your lack of a logical defense has only confirmed the Seer's finding. I'll cast my vote for May. Let's end this quickly.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
